  "description": "The Committee on Divine Worship's rules for Roman Rite liturgical publications approved for or distributed in the dioceses of the United States. The work defines publication categories and publisher responsibilities, gives authentication and permission procedures, and states requirements for participation aids and other publications that contain liturgical text. It enters into force on 29 November 2026; registration records the rules and their effective date without treating them as civil-law advice, an ecclesiastical classification of Triptych, a copyright license, or a release authorization.",
